	"transcription": [
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:00,000",
				"to": "00:00:03,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 3840
			},
			"text": " This question comes from Kim, who asks, \"What if there were a lake on the moon?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:03,840",
				"to": "00:00:05,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 3840,
				"to": 5120
			},
			"text": " What would it be like to swim in it?\""
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:05,120",
				"to": "00:00:09,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 5120,
				"to": 9160
			},
			"text": " (Presuming that it's sheltered in a regular atmosphere, in some giant dome or something.)"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:09,160",
				"to": "00:00:13,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 9160,
				"to": 13740
			},
			"text": " This would be so cool."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:13,740",
				"to": "00:00:17,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 13740,
				"to": 17280
			},
			"text": " I honestly think swimming on the moon is cool enough that it gives us a pretty good reason"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:17,280",
				"to": "00:00:19,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 17280,
				"to": 19160
			},
			"text": " to go to the moon in the first place."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:19,160",
				"to": "00:00:21,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 19160,
				"to": 21920
			},
			"text": " At the very least, it's better than the one Kennedy gave."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:21,920",
				"to": "00:00:24,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 21920,
				"to": 24640
			},
			"text": " Floating would feel about the same on the moon as on Earth, since how high in the water"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:24,640",
				"to": "00:00:28,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 24640,
				"to": 28040
			},
			"text": " you float depends only on your body's density compared to the waters and not the strength"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:28,040",
				"to": "00:00:29,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 28040,
				"to": 29400
			},
			"text": " of gravity."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:29,400",
				"to": "00:00:31,820"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 29400,
				"to": 31820
			},
			"text": " Swimming underwater would also feel pretty similar."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:31,820",
				"to": "00:00:35,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 31820,
				"to": 35440
			},
			"text": " The inertia of the water is the main source of drag when swimming, and inertia is a property"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:35,440",
				"to": "00:00:37,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 35440,
				"to": 37520
			},
			"text": " of matter, which is independent of gravity."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:37,520",
				"to": "00:00:41,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 37520,
				"to": 41000
			},
			"text": " The top speed of a submerged swimmer would be about the same on the moon as here, about"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:41,000",
				"to": "00:00:42,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 41000,
				"to": 42560
			},
			"text": " 2 meters per second."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:42,560",
				"to": "00:00:45,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 42560,
				"to": 45120
			},
			"text": " Everything else would be different and way cooler."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:45,120",
				"to": "00:00:48,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 45120,
				"to": 48320
			},
			"text": " The waves would be bigger, the splash fights more intense, and swimmers would be able to"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:48,320",
				"to": "00:00:50,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 48320,
				"to": 50280
			},
			"text": " jump out of the water like dolphins."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:50,280",
				"to": "00:00:53,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 50280,
				"to": 53240
			},
			"text": " Calculating the height a swimmer can jump out of the water requires taking several different"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:53,240",
				"to": "00:00:57,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 53240,
				"to": 57040
			},
			"text": " things into account, but the bottom line is that a normal swimmer on the moon could probably"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:57,040",
				"to": "00:00:59,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 57040,
				"to": 59200
			},
			"text": " launch themselves a full meter out of the water."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:59,200",
				"to": "00:01:02,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 59200,
				"to": 62520
			},
			"text": " An Olympic swimmer like Michael Phelps might manage 2 or 3 meters."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:02,520",
				"to": "00:01:05,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 62520,
				"to": 65880
			},
			"text": " The numbers get even more exciting when we introduce fins."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:05,880",
				"to": "00:01:09,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 65880,
				"to": 69440
			},
			"text": " Swimmers wearing monofins can exceed 3 meters per second, which is fast enough for some pretty"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:09,440",
				"to": "00:01:11,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 69440,
				"to": 71160
			},
			"text": " impressive jumps even on Earth."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:11,160",
				"to": "00:01:15,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 71160,
				"to": 75160
			},
			"text": " Data on fin swim top speeds and thrusts suggest that on the moon, a champion fin swimmer could"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:15,160",
				"to": "00:01:18,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 75160,
				"to": 78320
			},
			"text": " probably launch themselves as high as 4 or 5 meters into the air."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:18,320",
				"to": "00:01:23,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 78320,
				"to": 83040
			},
			"text": " In other words, on the moon, you could conceivably do a high dive in reverse."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:23,040",
				"to": "00:01:24,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 83040,
				"to": 84040
			},
			"text": " And it gets even better."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:24,040",
				"to": "00:01:28,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 84040,
				"to": 88360
			},
			"text": " A 2012 paper concluded that, while humans can't run on the surface of water on Earth,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:28,360",
				"to": "00:01:31,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 88360,
				"to": 91720
			},
			"text": " they might just barely be able to do so on the moon."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:31,720",
				"to": "00:01:33,820"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 91720,
				"to": 93820
			},
			"text": " Then we get to waves and splashes."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:33,820",
				"to": "00:01:36,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 93820,
				"to": 96900
			},
			"text": " Because of the reduced gravity on the moon, the water would be launched upwards much more"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:36,900",
				"to": "00:01:38,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 96900,
				"to": 98600
			},
			"text": " easily just like the swimmers."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:38,600",
				"to": "00:01:41,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 98600,
				"to": 101360
			},
			"text": " The result would be larger waves and more flying droplets."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:41,360",
				"to": "00:01:44,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 101360,
				"to": 104560
			},
			"text": " In technical terms, a pool on the moon would be more splashy."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:44,560",
				"to": "00:01:47,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 104560,
				"to": 107680
			},
			"text": " To avoid splashing all the water out, you'd want to design the deck so the water drains"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:47,680",
				"to": "00:01:48,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 107680,
				"to": 108920
			},
			"text": " quickly back into the pool."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:48,920",
				"to": "00:01:52,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 108920,
				"to": 112640
			},
			"text": " You could just make the rim higher, but then you'd spoil one of the key joys of a pool"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:52,640",
				"to": "00:01:55,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 112640,
				"to": 115640
			},
			"text": " on the moon, exiting via slip and slide."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:55,640",
				"to": "00:01:58,140"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 115640,
				"to": 118140
			},
			"text": " I 100% want to swim on the moon."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:58,140",
				"to": "00:02:01,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 118140,
				"to": 121720
			},
			"text": " If we ever build a moon base, I think we should absolutely put a big swimming pool there."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:01,720",
				"to": "00:02:05,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 121720,
				"to": 125400
			},
			"text": " Sure, sending a swimming pool's worth of water to the moon's surface would be expensive,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:05,400",
				"to": "00:02:08,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 125400,
				"to": 128720
			},
			"text": " but on the other hand, this lunar base is gonna have people on it so you're gonna need"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:08,720",
				"to": "00:02:10,820"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 128720,
				"to": 130820
			},
			"text": " to send some water anyway."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:10,820",
				"to": "00:02:14,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 130820,
				"to": 134000
			},
			"text": " And it's not really that hard or expensive in the grand scheme of things."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:14,000",
				"to": "00:02:17,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 134000,
				"to": 137920
			},
			"text": " A large backyard swimming pool weighs about as much as 4 Apollo lunar landers."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:17,920",
				"to": "00:02:21,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 137920,
				"to": 141840
			},
			"text": " We don't have any functioning Apollo Saturn V rockets, but NASA's SLS launch system is"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:21,840",
				"to": "00:02:25,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 141840,
				"to": 145360
			},
			"text": " ultimately intended to carry about the same amount as a Saturn V for the cost of a few"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:25,360",
				"to": "00:02:29,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 145360,
				"to": 149000
			},
			"text": " billion dollars per launch, and a private space company would be even cheaper."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:29,000",
				"to": "00:02:32,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 149000,
				"to": 152640
			},
			"text": " For comparison, the budget for the Summer Olympic Games is typically upwards of 10 billion"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:32,640",
				"to": "00:02:33,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 152640,
				"to": 153640
			},
			"text": " dollars."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:33,640",
				"to": "00:02:37,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 153640,
				"to": 157680
			},
			"text": " So, maybe the next step, if you really want a swimming pool on the moon, is to invite"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:37,680",
				"to": "00:02:41,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 157680,
				"to": 161200
			},
			"text": " the heads of NASA and the International Olympic Committee to your next pool party."
		}
	]
}
